      <a href="#contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold" style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; background:#B57A4A; color:#1A0F0A;">S'abonner — 14€</a>
